      story: "Google launched Gemini Deep Research in December 2024, OpenAI released deep research in ChatGPT in February 2025, and Anthropic added Research to Claude in April 2025. All follow a similar loop: plan the investigation, issue many searches, read sources, follow leads, and write a long report with citations. They made agentic research a mainstream product category, and they showed its characteristic risks: confident synthesis that overstates weak sources, and citations that do not support the sentences they are attached to.",
